(92982,0,40894464,8320,8,91380,0,0,0,'Decor Treasure Hunt','Solve the riddle and find the treasure.','Are you ready for today\'s challenge? I\'ve hidden a piece from my collection here in the neighborhood. To find it, you must merely solve this simple riddle:\n\nBeyond smugglers cove.\nWrecks hide a sunken saloon.\nLook for the good stuff.\n\nGood luck!','','',244531,1,64978);
