(93087,0,40894464,8320,8,117000,0,0,0,'Decor Treasure Hunt','Solve the riddle and find the treasure.','Are you ready for today\'s challenge? I\'ve hidden a piece from my collection here in the neighborhood. To find it, you must merely solve this simple riddle:\n\nBelow the towers.\nTownsfolk guarded from the spray.\nDig in awning\'s shade.\n\nGood luck!','','',246260,1,64978);
